  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICLEI - Local governments for Sustainability, South Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Kochi, Kerala, neglected canals have become toxic, endangering health, livelihoods, and flood resilience. Extreme flooding underscored the need for urgent action. Backed by Swiss Re Foundation, ICLEI South Asia, and bechtel.org, the Kochi Municipal Corporation is implementing a green-grey infrastructure approach that integrates nature-based solutions for waterway restoration. With a blueprint ready, catalytic funding is essential to pilot this model&#x2014;paving the way for India&#x2019;s first nature-based municipal bond to drive sustainable, climate-resilient urban water management</narrative>
  </description>
